window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All magic has a price....</b></p> <p>But what it cost me can never be given back.</p> <p>So I'll have to settle for vengeance.</p> <p><b>Don’t miss the epic finale for The Coven: Academy Magic in </b><b><i>The Secret Witch</i></b><b>. The problems for this sharp-witted heroine and swoon-worthy hero are only getting crazier. Fans of </b><b><i>The Mortal Instruments</i></b><b>, </b><b><i>Twilight</i></b><b>, or Harry Potter will love Chandelle LaVaun’s brand new urban fantasy series!</b></p>"; 
